    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BRA301 · Chapter 4 · Session 12 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 12 — Group Project Guildelines and Individual Assignment Guidelines</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13808 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BRA301 · Chương 4 · Buổi 12 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 12 — Group Project Guildelines and Individual Assignment Guidelines</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13808 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">IT</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">IT</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Group Project Guildelines and Individual Assignment Guidelines<br>Tutorial: online portfolio<br>Use AI to develop a brand campaign</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Textbooks, workbooks, PPT presentation, and other resources<br>Follow lecturer's guidance of using AI:<br>- Read the assignment carefully<br>- Write a clear prompt for the AI. Students can use AI tools for market research, audience segmentation, developing key messages, message testing and content creation.<br>- Reflect on how AI helped with building a brand campaign</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Discussion.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practise in the <a href=\"/exam?course=BRA301\">Exam Room — BRA301</a> (4 practice papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Luyện tại <a href=\"/exam?course=BRA301\">Phòng thi — BRA301</a> (4 đề luyện: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
